  "derivation": "E_lambda(p)=E(p)+lambda sum_free p_i(1-p_i). On binary boards R=0, hence all binary energies and true flip costs unchanged. Non-entropy negative gradient changes by lambda(2p_i-1) on free cells; original flip_delta certificate retained. Positive lambda adds concavity -2lambda in the continuous Hessian.",
